#: data/text/berries.inc:1
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GiveEnigmaBerry"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hi, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I just received a very rare BERRY.\n"
"I'd like you to have it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:6
msgctxt "Route104_Text_PlantBerriesInSoilTakeThis"
msgid ""
"If you see BERRIES growing in loamy\n"
"soil, feel free to take them.\p"
"But make sure you plant a BERRY in the\n"
"same spot. That's common courtesy.\p"
"Here, I'll share this with you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:13
msgctxt "Route104_Text_TrainersOftenMakeMonHoldBerries"
msgid ""
"The way you look, you must be a\n"
"TRAINER, no?\p"
"TRAINERS often make POKéMON hold\n"
"BERRIES.\p"
"It's up to you whether to grow BERRIES\n"
"or use them.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:21
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WateredPlantsEveryDayTakeBerry"
msgid ""
"I watered the plants every day.\n"
"They grew lots of flowers.\p"
"And they gave me lots of BERRIES, too.\p"
"Here you go!\n"
"You can have it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:28
msgctxt "Route111_Text_GoingToTryToMakeDifferentColorBerries"
msgid ""
"I'm going to try really hard and make\n"
"BERRIES in different colors.\p"
"I hope you try hard, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:33
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WhatColorBerriesToLookForToday"
msgid ""
"I wonder what color BERRIES I'll look\n"
"for today?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:37
msgctxt "Route114_Text_LoveUsingBerryCrushShareBerry"
msgid ""
"I love using the BERRY CRUSH machine,\n"
"so I'm collecting BERRIES.\p"
"I'll share one with you, if you'd like.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:42
msgctxt "Route114_Text_TryBerryCrushWithFriends"
msgid ""
"You should try the BERRY CRUSH\n"
"machine with your friends.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:46
msgctxt "Route114_Text_FunToThinkAboutBerries"
msgid ""
"Which BERRY should be planted?\n"
"Should you use or hoard BERRIES?\p"
"It's fun to think about.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:51
msgctxt "Route120_Text_BerriesExpressionOfLoveIsntIt"
msgid ""
"BERRIES grow by soaking up sunlight.\p"
"We help the BERRIES grow by watering\n"
"them regularly.\p"
"It's an expression of love, isn't it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:57
msgctxt "Route120_Text_YesYouUnderstand"
msgid ""
"Yes, yes.\n"
"You understand what I mean.\p"
"You should take this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:62
msgctxt "Route120_Text_MakeYourOwnImpressions"
msgid ""
"Oh… But it is important to make your\n"
"own impressions, I guess…\p"
"You can have this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:67
msgctxt "Route120_Text_BerryIsRareRaiseItWithCare"
msgid ""
"I think that BERRY is rare.\n"
"I hope you raise it with loving care.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:71
msgctxt "Route120_Text_IllGetMoreBerriesFromBerryMaster"
msgid ""
"I'll get more BERRIES from\n"
"the BERRY MASTER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:75
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BerrySuitsYou"
msgid ""
"When it gets right down to it…\p"
"The same way suits suit me perfectly,\n"
"a crisp breeze suits the sea.\p"
"And you, a BERRY suits you to a “T”…\p"
"Why should that be so?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:82
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BecauseYoureTrainer"
msgid ""
"When it gets right down to it…\p"
"It's because you're a TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:86
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_PokeblocksSuitPokemon"
msgid ""
"When it gets right down to it…\p"
"The way dignified simplicity suits me,\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}S perfectly suit POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:91
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_YoureDeservingOfBerry"
msgid ""
"You may call me the BERRY MASTER.\p"
"I dream of filling the world with\n"
"beautiful flowers, so I raise BERRIES\l"
"and hand them out to everyone.\p"
"You're deserving of one!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:98
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_WhyBeStingyTakeAnother"
msgid ""
"Why be stingy?\n"
"Take another!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:102
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_VisitPrettyPetalFlowerShop"
msgid ""
"Be sure to visit the PRETTY PETAL\n"
"flower shop near RUSTBORO.\p"
"Let flowers fill the world!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:107
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_DoneForToday"
msgid ""
"I'm done for today.\n"
"Come again another day.\p"
"Let flowers fill the world!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:112
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_HeardAGoodSayingLately"
msgid ""
"The way my husband grows BERRIES,\n"
"oh, he's the best in the world.\p"
"He makes me proud, that he does.\p"
"Incidentally, child, have you heard\n"
"a good saying lately?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:119
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_InspirationalTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Ah! What a remarkable saying!\n"
"Inspirational, it is!\p"
"I want you to have this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:124
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_GoodSayingTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Oh! A good saying it is.\n"
"You're quite remarkable.\p"
"I want you to have this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:129
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_JoyNeverGoesOutOfMyLife"
msgid ""
"Our four grandchildren should become\n"
"more accomplished than my husband.\p"
"Joy never goes out of my life!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:134
msgctxt "Route123_BerryMastersHouse_Text_Ah"
msgid "Ah…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:137
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_ThisIsPrettyPetalFlowerShop"
msgid ""
"Hello!\p"
"This is the PRETTY PETAL flower shop.\n"
"Spreading flowers all over the world!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:142
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_LearnAboutBerries"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, would you like to learn about\n"
"BERRIES?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:146
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_IntroLearnAboutBerries"
msgid ""
"Your name is?\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"That's a nice name.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, would you like to learn about\n"
"BERRIES?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:153
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_BerriesExplanation"
msgid ""
"BERRIES grow on trees that thrive\n"
"only in soft, loamy soil.\p"
"If you take some BERRIES, be sure to\n"
"plant one in the loamy soil again.\p"
"A planted BERRY will soon sprout,\n"
"grow into a plant, flower beautifully,\l"
"then grow BERRIES again.\p"
"I want to see the whole wide world\n"
"filled with beautiful flowers.\l"
"That's my dream.\p"
"Please help me, {PLAYER}{KUN}. Plant BERRIES\n"
"and bring more flowers into the world.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:167
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_FlowersBringHappiness"
msgid ""
"Flowers bring so much happiness to\n"
"people, don't they?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:171
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_YouCanHaveThis"
msgid ""
"Hello!\p"
"The more attention you give to flowers,\n"
"the more beautifully they bloom.\p"
"You'll like tending flowers. I'm sure\n"
"of it. You can have this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:178
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_WailmerPailExplanation"
msgid ""
"While BERRY plants are growing,\n"
"water them with the WAILMER PAIL.\p"
"Oh, another thing.\p"
"If you don't pick BERRIES for a while,\n"
"they'll drop off onto the ground.\l"
"But they'll sprout again.\p"
"Isn't that awesome?\n"
"It's like they have the will to live.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:188
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_ImGrowingFlowers"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to be like my big sisters.\n"
"I'm growing flowers, too!\p"
"Here you go!\n"
"It's for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:194
msgctxt "Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Text_MachineMixesBerries"
msgid ""
"You can plant a BERRY and grow it big,\n"
"or you can make a POKéMON hold it.\p"
"But now they have a machine that mixes\n"
"up different BERRIES and makes candies\l"
"for POKéMON.\p"
"I want some candy, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:202
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_NameIsKiriHaveOneOfThese"
msgid ""
"Hi, what's your name?\p"
"… … …  … … …  … … …\n"
"Okay. That's nice!\p"
"My name is KIRI.\p"
"My mommy and daddy named me that so\n"
"I would grow healthy and warmhearted.\l"
"That's what they wished.\p"
"You can have one of these.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:212
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_GiveYouThisBerryToo"
msgid ""
"KIRI will give you this BERRY, too!\n"
"I really like it lots!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:216
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_WhatKindOfWishInYourName"
msgid ""
"I wonder what kind of wish is included\n"
"in your name.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:220
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_LikeSeasonBornIn"
msgid ""
"Spring, summer, autumn, and winter.\p"
"If you're born in springtime, do you like\n"
"the spring, and if you're born in the\l"
"summer, do you like the summer?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:226
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_ThenILoveAutumn"
msgid ""
"Then KIRI was born in the autumn,\n"
"so I love the autumn!\p"
"Which season do you like?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/berries.inc:231
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_OhDoesntMatter"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"It doesn't matter…\p"
"There's so much that I want to know…$"
msgstr ""
